### Revoke access token (RFC 7009)
POST http://localhost:8080/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE&token_type_hint=access_token

### Revoke refresh token (RFC 7009)
POST http://localhost:8080/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE&token_type_hint=refresh_token

### Revoke unknown token — expect 200 OK anyway (RFC 7009 §2.2)
POST http://localhost:8080/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=nonexistent-token-xyz
